    <string name="fountains_help_title">About the fountains map</string>
    <string name="fountains_help_text">Fountains, taps and drinkable springs come from OpenStreetMap, a map made by volunteers (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL licence). Data may be missing, outdated or wrong: a fountain can be broken, turned off in winter or removed. Check the “last checked” date when shown.\n\nWhen you move the map, Able sends only the visible map area to a public Overpass server (overpass-api.de, or overpass.kumi.systems as a fallback) and downloads map images from the OpenStreetMap tile servers. Your position is never sent; there is no account and nothing else leaves the phone. Results are kept on this phone for up to 24 hours.\n\nAble does not edit OpenStreetMap. To add or fix a fountain, use “Open in OpenStreetMap”.</string>

